-daniels\nRussell Samora -> https://pudding.cool/author/russell-samora\nWikipedia API -> https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/API:Main_page\nthis map -> https://www.wearedorothy.com/collections/music/products/u-s-a-song-map-open-edition"}],"details":{},"isError":false,"timestamp":1793240544919}}
